**Fix:** Make `_copy_tree_contents` resilient to per-entry failures — catch each entry's exception, record it, and continue processing the remaining entries. After all entries are processed, if any failed, raise a single `OSError` so the main loop sets `had_error`. This matches the spec: "diagnose per-source failures and continue; do not roll back completed operations."

